### Generate an image, streaming progress
POST {{api-uri}}/izzybot/images
Accept: text/event-stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "a lighthouse on a cliff in a storm, dramatic lighting, photorealistic"
}

### Generate an image, one JSON response (blocks 5-15s)
POST {{api-uri}}}/izzybot/images/sync
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "a lighthouse on a cliff in a storm, dramatic lighting, photorealistic"
}

### Download a generated image
GET {{api-uri}}/izzybot/images/{{imageId}}

### Read a generated image's provenance without the bytes
GET {{api-uri}}/izzybot/images/{{imageId}}/metadata

###
